[{"id":26,"slug":"silhouettes-at-the-end-of-the-day","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2026/10/silhouettes-at-the-end-of-the-day/","date_gmt":"2026-10-09T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"Silhouettes at the end of the day"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Some portrait sessions work better when nobody looks at the camera. This one was planned for the hour before sunset, with a single rule: keep the light behind the people and let them be shapes.</p>\n<p>I asked for plain clothes and no hats, so the outline stays simple and the horizon does the work. Everything below was shot between the last warm light and the first cool blue.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-01.jpg\" alt=\"Small walking figure against a pink and red dusk sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A small figure walking along a low horizon at dusk.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-02.jpg\" alt=\"Two small figures on a hill path against a bright sun\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A path over a hill, with the last light behind it.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-03.jpg\" alt=\"Dark figure standing on the shore with waves behind\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A figure standing at the edge of the surf.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>We started on a low ridge, where there was nothing between us and the sky. A figure that is small in the frame reads as calm, so I stayed back and used the longer lens.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-04.jpg\" alt=\"Silhouette of a head and shoulders above the sea at sunset\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\"><figcaption>A head and shoulders against the water at sunset.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-05.jpg\" alt=\"Silhouette of a gull flying across a low sun\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A gull crossing the sun.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-06.jpg\" alt=\"Orange clouds above waves on a wet beach\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Orange cloud over a wet beach.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-07.jpg\" alt=\"Long wooden jetty on calm water under a purple sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A wooden jetty reaching into still water at dusk.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Down at the water</h2>\n<p>On the beach the light bounced up from the wet sand, which gave the shapes a soft edge. Waiting for the wave to pull back was most of the work.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-08.jpg\" alt=\"Low sun and a line of small waves on the sea\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1062\"><figcaption>The sun going down behind a line of small waves.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-09.jpg\" alt=\"Two tiny figures on a pale beach in hazy light\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1060\"><figcaption>Two small figures on a pale beach, far apart.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-10.jpg\" alt=\"Several seated figures on a ridge under a sunset sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1064\"><figcaption>A few people sitting on a ridge, watching the sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-11.jpg\" alt=\"Two figures walking up a grassy hillside in bright backlight\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Two figures walking up a grassy ridge, seen from behind.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The sky did the rest. I changed almost nothing between frames except where the people stood, and I kept the exposure set for the brightest part of the sky.</p>\n<p>The last frames were taken in light so low that a phone screen looked like a lamp. That was the signal to stop and walk back before the path disappeared.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>This is sample content for the Second Shooter template. The story is invented, and the photographs are public domain or CC0 pictures from Wikimedia Commons, so each caption describes only what is in the picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunset_field_(Unsplash).jpg\">Featured photograph</a>, Philipp Reiner, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Walking_Silhouette_(Unsplash).jpg\">A small figure walking along a low horizon at dusk</a>, Islam Hassan, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Silhouettes_at_Sunrise_(Unsplash).jpg\">A path over a hill, with the last light behind it</a>, Adriel Kloppenburg, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Silhouette_on_the_beach_(Unsplash).jpg\">A figure standing at the edge of the surf</a>, Lenart Lipovšek, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Silhouette_in_the_sea_at_sunset_(Unsplash).jpg\">A head and shoulders against the water at sunset</a>, Sweet Ice Cream Photography, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunrise_seagull_silhouette_(Unsplash).jpg\">A gull crossing the sun</a>, Alex Wigan, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Red_sky_sunset_(Unsplash).jpg\">Orange cloud over a wet beach</a>, Quino Al, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunset_by_the_Pier_(Unsplash).jpg\">A wooden jetty reaching into still water at dusk</a>, Paul Carmona, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Golden_Hour_(Unsplash).jpg\">The sun going down behind a line of small waves</a>, Evelyn Werner, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Surfer_silhouettes_on_Cannon_Beach_(Unsplash).jpg\">Two small figures on a pale beach, far apart</a>, Jamison McAndie, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunset_Picnic_(Unsplash).jpg\">A few people sitting on a ridge, watching the sky</a>, Arthur Poulin, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Through_the_sunset_(Unsplash).jpg\">Two figures walking up a grassy ridge, seen from behind</a>, Pablo Heimplatz, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A portrait session with no faces in it: people as plain shapes against the last light."},"author":25,"categories":[3],"tags":[5,6],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":25,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":27,"slug":"sunrise-on-a-sea-cliff","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2026/09/sunrise-on-a-sea-cliff/","date_gmt":"2026-09-02T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"Sunrise on a sea cliff"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The plan was short: be on the cliff before the sun, say what they wanted to say, and be back at the car before anyone else arrived. We met in the dark with two flasks and a printed route.</p>\n<p>Cliff elopements are mostly about waiting. The light changes every few minutes, the wind decides how long a veil can stay up, and the best frame is often the one you take while everyone is looking at the sea.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-01.jpg\" alt=\"White sea cliffs with two rock stacks in the water\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>White cliffs and two stacks standing off the shore.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-02.jpg\" alt=\"Pebble beach under a tree-covered headland in warm tones\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A pebble beach below a wooded headland.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-03.jpg\" alt=\"Waterfall falling from a cliff onto a turquoise cove\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\"><figcaption>A small waterfall dropping onto a cove.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-04.jpg\" alt=\"Two dark rock walls with a wet beach and sky between them\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Two rock walls and a wet beach between them.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The first hour was walking. The path along the top was narrow, with grass on one side and a long drop on the other, so we went slowly and talked about nothing in particular.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-05.jpg\" alt=\"Sandy path winding through dune grass beside a wooden fence\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1062\"><figcaption>A sandy path through dune grass, with a fence beside it.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-06.jpg\" alt=\"Orange sun low over calm water\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>The sun low over flat, warm water.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-07.jpg\" alt=\"Footprints in damp sand beside a driftwood log at sunset\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Footprints in damp sand and a log at low tide.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-08.jpg\" alt=\"Red flowering plants on a cliff top above the blue sea\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\"><figcaption>Red flowers along a cliff edge above the sea.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-09.jpg\" alt=\"Large boulders on a rocky beach with a bright sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Boulders on a rocky beach under a bright sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>When the sun came up</h2>\n<p>The ceremony took six minutes. After that the two of them sat on the edge with their legs over and I took very few photographs, because there was nothing I needed to add.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-10.jpg\" alt=\"Small waves on dark sand with light low on the horizon\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1071\"><figcaption>Waves running up dark sand in low light.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-11.jpg\" alt=\"Sea spray catching the light of a low sun\" width=\"1280\" height=\"931\"><figcaption>Spray lit by the setting sun.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-12.jpg\" alt=\"Rocky headlands above a sandy bay in morning haze\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Three rocky points over a sandy bay, in haze.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-13.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of a white cliff above dark green sea\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1068\"><figcaption>A white cliff face above dark green water, from above.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>We walked down to the beach for the last part of the morning. Low tide gave us flat wet sand, and the light bounced up from it onto everything.</p>\n<p>By nine the first dog walkers came along the path. We were already in the car with the heater on, looking through the back of the camera and agreeing on which frames to keep.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>This is sample content for the Second Shooter template. The story is invented, and the photographs are public domain or CC0 pictures from Wikimedia Commons, so each caption describes only what is in the picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ocean_cliff_sunset_(Unsplash).jpg\">Featured photograph</a>, Sweet Ice Cream Photography, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Beautiful_cliff_around_beach_(Unsplash).jpg\">White cliffs and two stacks standing off the shore</a>, Joseph Barrientos, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bornholm_cliff_(Unsplash).jpg\">A pebble beach below a wooded headland</a>, Julia Caesar, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cliffs_by_the_ocean_bay_(Unsplash).jpg\">A small waterfall dropping onto a cove</a>, Emilce Giardino, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pfeiffer_Beach_at_Dusk_(Unsplash).jpg\">Two rock walls and a wet beach between them</a>, Kace Rodriguez, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sandy_Atlantic_beach_(Unsplash).jpg\">A sandy path through dune grass, with a fence beside it</a>, Erda Estremera, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Seaside_At_Sunrise_(Unsplash).jpg\">The sun low over flat, warm water</a>, Good Free Photos, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ocean_sunset_(Unsplash).jpg\">Footprints in damp sand and a log at low tide</a>, Cody Weiher, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rocky_coastline_(Unsplash).jpg\">Red flowers along a cliff edge above the sea</a>, Sean Oldham, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Little_Corona_Beach_sunrise_(Unsplash).jpg\">Boulders on a rocky beach under a bright sky</a>, Austin Neill, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Waves_washes_on_beach_shore_(Unsplash).jpg\">Waves running up dark sand in low light</a>, Barn Images, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunset_Cliffs_splashing_coastline_(Unsplash).jpg\">Spray lit by the setting sun</a>, Matteo Paganelli, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Three_Cliffs_(Unsplash).jpg\">Three rocky points over a sandy bay, in haze</a>, Felix Russell-Saw, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:White_Cliffs_(Unsplash).jpg\">A white cliff face above dark green water, from above</a>, Unleashed Agency, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A two-person elopement at first light on a cliff path, with notes on what the sea does to a plan."},"author":25,"categories":[2],"tags":[7,6],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":25,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":28,"slug":"a-white-chapel-above-the-sea","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2026/06/a-white-chapel-above-the-sea/","date_gmt":"2026-06-20T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A white chapel above the sea"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The chapel holds about forty people if nobody minds sitting close. On the day there were twenty-two, which meant the pews were full at the front and empty at the back, and the room felt like a long exhale.</p>\n<p>I arrived two hours early to see where the light would fall. White walls are generous: they push light back into the room, so I rarely needed more than a single lens and a steady hand.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-01.jpg\" alt=\"White church with a tall spire in front of a wooded mountain\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>A white church with a tall spire, at the foot of a mountain.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-02.jpg\" alt=\"Small white chapel with a square tower among bare trees\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A smaller chapel in a clearing, among bare trees.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-03.jpg\" alt=\"White wooden chapel behind a picket fence under a pale sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1097\"><figcaption>White fence, white walls and a soft pink sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-04.jpg\" alt=\"White church with a steeple among trees at dusk\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1201\"><figcaption>Evening light on a village church.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-05.jpg\" alt=\"White steeple above autumn trees mirrored in still water\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1071\"><figcaption>A spire above autumn trees, reflected in a lake.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-06.jpg\" alt=\"Small chapel with a red roof below green mountains\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>A tiny red-roofed chapel under big green hills.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Before the guests, I walked around the outside. Small chapels look different from every side, and the couple wanted a picture of the building by itself, with nobody in it.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-07.jpg\" alt=\"Church aisle with pews decorated with small flower arrangements\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1065\"><figcaption>Small bunches tied to the end of each pew.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-08.jpg\" alt=\"Jar of white flowers tied to the end of a wooden pew\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1065\"><figcaption>Baby's breath in a glass jar on a wooden pew.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-09.jpg\" alt=\"Bouquet of flowers hanging on a dark wooden pew\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1068\"><figcaption>A bouquet hung low in a dim church.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-10.jpg\" alt=\"Pink roses in soft focus\" width=\"1066\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Pink roses, soft in the late light.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Inside</h2>\n<p>Someone had tied small bunches of flowers to the end of each pew with string. In a dim room they are the only colour, so I photographed them from low down, at the height a child would see them.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-11.jpg\" alt=\"Cherry tree in blossom beside a park path and bench\" width=\"953\" height=\"1440\"><figcaption>A cherry tree in bloom beside the path.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-12.jpg\" alt=\"Two gold rings lying on the pages of an open book\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Two plain gold rings resting on an open book.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-13.jpg\" alt=\"White cliff above a sandy beach and blue sea\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"><figcaption>Where the cliff drops to a sandy beach.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-14.jpg\" alt=\"Grassy headlands and cliffs meeting deep blue sea\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"><figcaption>Headlands running out into dark blue water.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>After the ceremony we walked to the headland. The wind had picked up, and the walk was short enough that nobody minded the cold.</p>\n<p>The reception was lunch in a hall down the road, and I stopped photographing once the plates came out. The last frame I kept is two plain rings on an open book, taken while the vicar was finding the page.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>This is sample content for the Second Shooter template. The story is invented, and the photographs are public domain or CC0 pictures from Wikimedia Commons, so each caption describes only what is in the picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hellnar_Church,_Iceland_(Unsplash).jpg\">Featured photograph</a>, lydia, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Church_at_a_mountain%27s_foot_(Unsplash).jpg\">A white church with a tall spire, at the foot of a mountain</a>, Gabriel Garcia Marengo, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_white_chapel_(Unsplash).jpg\">A smaller chapel in a clearing, among bare trees</a>, Harry Miller, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Country_Church_(Unsplash).jpg\">White fence, white walls and a soft pink sky</a>, Jerry Kiesewetter, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Quaint_white_church_(Unsplash).jpg\">Evening light on a village church</a>, Aaron Burden, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Little_White_Church_(Unsplash).jpg\">A spire above autumn trees, reflected in a lake</a>, Peter Lewis, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Church_by_the_green_mountains_(Unsplash).jpg\">A tiny red-roofed chapel under big green hills</a>, Michael James, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wedding_aisle_in_old_church_(Unsplash).jpg\">Small bunches tied to the end of each pew</a>, Annie Spratt, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flowers_in_a_church_aisle_(Unsplash).jpg\">Baby's breath in a glass jar on a wooden pew</a>, Annie Spratt, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Church_on_the_morning_of_the_wedding_(Unsplash).jpg\">A bouquet hung low in a dim church</a>, Jez Timms, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pastel_pink_roses_(Unsplash).jpg\">Pink roses, soft in the late light</a>, Alina Sofia, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cherry_flowers_in_the_park_(Unsplash).jpg\">A cherry tree in bloom beside the path</a>, Khürt Williams, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wedding_rings_(Unsplash).jpg\">Two plain gold rings resting on an open book</a>, Glen McCallum, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cliff_on_a_sandy_coastline_(Unsplash).jpg\">Where the cliff drops to a sandy beach</a>, Mukesh M, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Seaside_Cliffs_(Unsplash).jpg\">Headlands running out into dark blue water</a>, Josh Aarons, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"Notes from a small wedding at a white chapel on a headland, and the quiet details around it."},"author":25,"categories":[1],"tags":[8,7],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":25,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":29,"slug":"three-quiet-beaches-and-a-dune","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2026/05/three-quiet-beaches-and-a-dune/","date_gmt":"2026-05-12T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"Three quiet beaches and a dune"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>This is a working guide, not a list of secrets. It covers the kind of place that is empty on a weekday morning and busy by noon: a wide beach, a pier, a row of huts and one dune that is worth the walk.</p>\n<p>For each place I note when the light is kindest, how far you walk from the car and what to do when the wind drops or the tide comes in.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-01.jpg\" alt=\"Dark sand dunes under a hazy sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\"><figcaption>Dark dunes under a hazy morning sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-02.jpg\" alt=\"Large sand dune with two tiny figures walking along the ridge\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1071\"><figcaption>A tall dune with two tiny walkers on the ridge.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-03.jpg\" alt=\"Footprints on a sand dune under a blue sky with clouds\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Footprints across a dune under a blue sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The dune</h2>\n<p>Go early. Sand holds footprints, so the first hour is the only time the ridge looks clean. Bring a cloth for the lens and keep the camera in a bag while you climb.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-04.jpg\" alt=\"Bright blue sea below a green cliff and a white beach\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"><figcaption>Bright blue water below a green cliff.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-05.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of a wave breaking onto a sandy beach\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A wave folding onto the sand, seen from above.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-06.jpg\" alt=\"Long pier extending over a wide beach with a few people\" width=\"1600\" height=\"929\"><figcaption>A long pier and a wide, flat beach.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-07.jpg\" alt=\"Row of brightly painted beach huts on pale sand\" width=\"1600\" height=\"946\"><figcaption>A row of colourful beach huts on pale sand.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The wide beach</h2>\n<p>A flat beach gives you a lot of sky. Put people small in the frame and let the horizon sit in the top third. The tide line leaves a reflective band that works as a second horizon.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-08.jpg\" alt=\"Red wooden lifeguard stand on a sandy beach\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1068\"><figcaption>A red lifeguard stand on bare sand.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-09.jpg\" alt=\"Hand holding thick ropes with a sandy beach and sea behind\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A hand on a thick rope, with the beach beyond.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-10.jpg\" alt=\"Wind ripples on a smooth sand dune at dusk\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Wind ripples on a smooth dune.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The huts and the pier</h2>\n<p>Places with a landmark are easy to find and easy to share, which is why you should go on a weekday. The colours of the huts look best in flat light, under cloud.</p>\n<p>A last note on sand: it gets into everything. A zip bag for the spare lens and a rain cover over the body will save a repair bill.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>This is sample content for the Second Shooter template. The story is invented, and the photographs are public domain or CC0 pictures from Wikimedia Commons, so each caption describes only what is in the picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nagtabon_Beach,_Puerto_Princesa_(Unsplash).jpg\">Featured photograph</a>, Elise Iovenko, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Desert_Dunes_(Unsplash).jpg\">Dark dunes under a hazy morning sky</a>, Joe Mania, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hiking_Through_Sand_Dunes_(Unsplash).jpg\">A tall dune with two tiny walkers on the ridge</a>, Keith Hardy, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Patterns_in_Desert_Sand_(Unsplash).jpg\">Footprints across a dune under a blue sky</a>, Diego Jimenez, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Paradise_beach_(Unsplash).jpg\">Bright blue water below a green cliff</a>, kostas Nakos, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ocean_washing_on_the_beach_(Unsplash).jpg\">A wave folding onto the sand, seen from above</a>, Sarah Bürvenich, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Beach_by_the_pier_(Unsplash).jpg\">A long pier and a wide, flat beach</a>, Dakota Corbin, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Colorful_beach_huts_on_beach_(Unsplash).jpg\">A row of colourful beach huts on pale sand</a>, Arno Smit, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lifeguard_tower_on_a_beach_(Unsplash_gqvh3l_T6O0).jpg\">A red lifeguard stand on bare sand</a>, Natalie Collins, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ropes_on_a_sandy_beach_(Unsplash).jpg\">A hand on a thick rope, with the beach beyond</a>, Rebecca Li, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Desert_(Unsplash).jpg\">Wind ripples on a smooth dune</a>, Piotr Chrobot, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A short guide to shooting on wide, empty beaches and one big dune, with the light notes I wish I had earlier."},"author":25,"categories":[4],"tags":[9,10],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":25,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":30,"slug":"a-harbour-town-and-its-footbridges","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2026/02/a-harbour-town-and-its-footbridges/","date_gmt":"2026-02-24T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A harbour town and its footbridges"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Water is the easiest backdrop to plan around, because it is rarely in the way. This guide covers a small harbour, three kinds of bridge and a stretch of coast road, all within a short drive of each other.</p>\n<p>I shot it in winter, on a cold bright morning, and I would go back in any season except high summer, when the car park fills by ten.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-01.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of rows of boats in a marina\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"><figcaption>A marina seen from straight above.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-02.jpg\" alt=\"Wooden planks covered in yellow lichen with a pair of shoes at the bottom\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Weathered planks with yellow lichen, seen from above.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-03.jpg\" alt=\"Small sailing boat tilted in shallow water near a beach\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"><figcaption>A small boat leaning in the shallows.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-04.jpg\" alt=\"Orange and pink sky above a dark tree line over water\" width=\"1600\" height=\"936\"><figcaption>Sunset colour above a dark shoreline.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The harbour</h2>\n<p>Start from above if you can. A marina looks like a pattern from a high point, and the boats give you something to point out when a couple needs a quiet minute.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-05.jpg\" alt=\"Rope suspension bridge through dark green forest with a distant walker\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A rope footbridge between tall trees.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-06.jpg\" alt=\"Wide wooden bridge with railings under a grey sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"976\"><figcaption>A wide wooden bridge in grey light.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-07.jpg\" alt=\"Stone arch bridge on a coast road above a bay\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A stone arch bridge along a coast road.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-08.jpg\" alt=\"Small arched wooden bridge over still water among trees\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1440\"><figcaption>A small wooden bridge over still water in the woods.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-09.jpg\" alt=\"Canal with boats and tall old buildings in warm evening light\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\"><figcaption>A canal lined with tall old buildings and boats.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The bridges</h2>\n<p>Each bridge gives a different kind of picture. A rope bridge makes people walk slowly and hold on. A wide wooden one gives space for a group. A stone arch is best seen from a distance.</p>\n<p>End the day at a canal or a shore where the light goes orange, and keep one frame for the empty place after everyone has gone.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>This is sample content for the Second Shooter template. The story is invented, and the photographs are public domain or CC0 pictures from Wikimedia Commons, so each caption describes only what is in the picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Beachside_Bridge_(Unsplash).jpg\">Featured photograph</a>, James Besser, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Harbor_from_the_sky_(Unsplash).jpg\">A marina seen from straight above</a>, Geran de Klerk, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Narrow_walking_by_harbor_(Unsplash).jpg\">Weathered planks with yellow lichen, seen from above</a>, freddie, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tilted_boat_near_harbor_(Unsplash).jpg\">A small boat leaning in the shallows</a>, Rafael Kellermann Streit, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunsets_over_Gig_Harbor_(Unsplash).jpg\">Sunset colour above a dark shoreline</a>, Aidan Brown, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bridge_in_green_woods_(Unsplash).jpg\">A rope footbridge between tall trees</a>, Eric Huang, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Curved_wooden_bridge_(Unsplash).jpg\">A wide wooden bridge in grey light</a>, Brage Neslein Korsnes, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bixby_Bridge_(Unsplash).jpg\">A stone arch bridge along a coast road</a>, Dan Gold, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tree_bridge_(Unsplash).jpg\">A small wooden bridge over still water in the woods</a>, Tim Bogdanov, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Canal_in_Venezia,_Italy_(Unsplash).jpg\">A canal lined with tall old buildings and boats</a>, Jenny Kim, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A weekend guide to a harbour, a few footbridges and a coast road, for couples who want water in the frame."},"author":25,"categories":[4],"tags":[11,12],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":25,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":31,"slug":"two-people-and-a-pine-forest","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2025/11/two-people-and-a-pine-forest/","date_gmt":"2025-11-18T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"Two people and a pine forest"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>They wrote to me in September with one request: no guests, no schedule, a forest. We agreed on a morning in November, when the light is low and the paths are empty.</p>\n<p>Forests are hard to photograph because everything is the same height. The job is to find the one thing that is different, a gap, a path, a beam of light, and wait for it.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-01.jpg\" alt=\"Tall pine trunks in a dense green forest\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Tall trunks, close together.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-02.jpg\" alt=\"Fog drifting over dark green fir trees on a slope\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Fog moving through green fir trees on a slope.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-03.jpg\" alt=\"Slender pine trees above a floor of green moss\" width=\"1600\" height=\"894\"><figcaption>Slim pines over a floor of green moss.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-04.jpg\" alt=\"Low cloud on a mountainside covered in conifers\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Cloud settling on a wooded mountainside.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-05.jpg\" alt=\"Wooden boardwalk path curving through a forest\" width=\"1066\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A wooden boardwalk winding between trees.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>We walked in from the road. Mist sat between the trunks and the whole place smelled of resin and wet needles. I kept the camera low and the lens wide.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-06.jpg\" alt=\"Narrow overgrown path between red-brown pine trunks\" width=\"1440\" height=\"960\"><figcaption>A narrow path between red-brown trunks.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-07.jpg\" alt=\"Wet road leading into fog between bare trees\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"><figcaption>A wet road disappearing into fog.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-08.jpg\" alt=\"Straight road between tall dark trees\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A straight road between dark walls of trees.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-09.jpg\" alt=\"Upward view of tall trunks and sky in a circle\" width=\"1440\" height=\"960\"><figcaption>Looking straight up into a ring of trunks.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-10.jpg\" alt=\"Long tree shadows over a forest floor in low sunlight\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Long shadows across a floor of fallen needles.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The ceremony</h2>\n<p>They had written their own words, and read them to each other under a tree that had fallen across the track. It took ten minutes. I stood well back and used the long lens.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-11.jpg\" alt=\"Forest track leading to a wooden gate between dark trees\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\"><figcaption>A wooden gate at the end of a forest track.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-12.jpg\" alt=\"Black and white view upward at tall trees in fog\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Fog above very tall trees, in black and white.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-13.jpg\" alt=\"Sunlight through tall trunks onto a bright green mossy floor\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Sun through the trunks onto bright green moss.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-14.jpg\" alt=\"Large rocks covered in thick green moss\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1071\"><figcaption>Boulders under a thick layer of moss.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-15.jpg\" alt=\"Mossy trees and roots in a green forest\" width=\"1440\" height=\"960\"><figcaption>Moss on every branch and root.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Afterwards we followed the track uphill until the trees thinned. Moss covered everything, and the light was so even that I could shoot without thinking about exposure.</p>\n<p>We finished with a flask of something hot on a log. If you are planning a forest elopement, bring dry socks for everyone and allow twice as long as you think.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>This is sample content for the Second Shooter template. The story is invented, and the photographs are public domain or CC0 pictures from Wikimedia Commons, so each caption describes only what is in the picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunrise_breaking_into_the_forest_(Unsplash).jpg\">Featured photograph</a>, Kristine Weilert, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Thick_pine_forest_(Unsplash).jpg\">Tall trunks, close together</a>, Jude Dias, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lush_green_pine_forest_(Unsplash).jpg\">Fog moving through green fir trees on a slope</a>, Andrew Coelho, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Green_coniferous_forest_(Unsplash).jpg\">Slim pines over a floor of green moss</a>, Brownie, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Misty_coniferous_forest_on_a_slope_(Unsplash).jpg\">Cloud settling on a wooded mountainside</a>, Jon Flobrant, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Forest_boardwalk_(Unsplash).jpg\">A wooden boardwalk winding between trees</a>, Bryan Rodriguez, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Overgrown_forest_path_(Unsplash).jpg\">A narrow path between red-brown trunks</a>, Kirill Nechmonya, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Misty_road_by_a_forest_(Unsplash).jpg\">A wet road disappearing into fog</a>, Bara Cross, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wet_forest_road_(Unsplash_86T4OpohLTI).jpg\">A straight road between dark walls of trees</a>, Joe Gardner, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gazing_up_in_the_forest_(Unsplash).jpg\">Looking straight up into a ring of trunks</a>, Stefan Steinbauer, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Forest_tree_shadows_(Unsplash).jpg\">Long shadows across a floor of fallen needles</a>, Simson Petrol, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Forest_gateway_(Unsplash).jpg\">A wooden gate at the end of a forest track</a>, Thomas Rohlfs, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dark_forest_canopy_(Unsplash).jpg\">Fog above very tall trees, in black and white</a>, Phoebe Strafford, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tree_shadows_on_moss_(Unsplash).jpg\">Sun through the trunks onto bright green moss</a>, Sven Schlager, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rocks_under_thick_moss_(Unsplash).jpg\">Boulders under a thick layer of moss</a>, Jeff Cooper, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Verdant_mossy_trees_(Unsplash).jpg\">Moss on every branch and root</a>, Matthew Murphy, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"An elopement on a misty autumn morning in a pine forest, with no guests and a short list of rules."},"author":25,"categories":[2],"tags":[13,14],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":25,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":32,"slug":"a-barn-in-the-hills","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2025/09/a-barn-in-the-hills/","date_gmt":"2025-09-30T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A barn in the hills"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The barn sits at the end of a track, with a field on three sides and a view of the hills on the fourth. By the time I arrived the tables were already out, and a few people were sweeping the floor with a broom that was taller than they were.</p>\n<p>A barn wedding is a long day. People arrive early, stay late and wander in and out, so the photographs are as much about the place as the vows.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-01.jpg\" alt=\"Red barn behind trees and tall yellow grass\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A red barn half hidden by trees and tall grass.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-02.jpg\" alt=\"Small barn on a plain below a jagged range lit pink by the sun\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1280\"><figcaption>A lone barn below a jagged mountain range.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-03.jpg\" alt=\"Misty green hills with a small barn and a track\" width=\"1600\" height=\"921\"><figcaption>Mist lifting from green hills and a small barn.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-04.jpg\" alt=\"Yellow flowering field with a small hut under a cloudy sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>A yellow field under a wide cloudy sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-05.jpg\" alt=\"Wooden fence beside a green meadow with trees and hills\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1013\"><figcaption>A wooden fence along a green meadow.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>I always start outside, before the guests arrive. The field is half the story: tall grass, a fence, and a sky that changes every ten minutes.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-06.jpg\" alt=\"Sun behind a pine tree at the edge of a meadow with mountains\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1087\"><figcaption>Low sun behind a lone pine at the edge of a meadow.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-07.jpg\" alt=\"Backlit golden grass in a meadow\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Tall grass lit gold at the end of the day.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-08.jpg\" alt=\"Many paper lanterns hanging from a round frame\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Paper lanterns in orange and cream, hung overhead.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-09.jpg\" alt=\"Red paper lanterns hanging from a branch above a lake\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Red paper lanterns on a bare branch above the water.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Light for the evening</h2>\n<p>There is no electric light in the loft, so everything was lanterns and candles. A single flame looks small in a big room, but it carries more than you expect.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-10.jpg\" alt=\"One white candle in a brass holder on a wooden table\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A single candle in a brass holder on a wooden table.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-11.jpg\" alt=\"Three patterned red candles in front of a bright window with bunting\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Three candles by a bright window with paper flags behind.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-12.jpg\" alt=\"Yellow black-eyed Susan flowers\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"><figcaption>Black-eyed Susans in full bloom.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-13.jpg\" alt=\"Dark storm clouds above a green field with a long low barn\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1060\"><figcaption>Storm clouds over a green field and a long low barn.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Outside again after the toasts. The grass had turned gold and someone had picked a handful of flowers from the verge and put them in a jar.</p>\n<p>By eleven the field was dark and the barn glowed from inside. I packed up while the music was still going, and drove home with the window open to keep awake.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>This is sample content for the Second Shooter template. The story is invented, and the photographs are public domain or CC0 pictures from Wikimedia Commons, so each caption describes only what is in the picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Barn_(Unsplash).jpg\">Featured photograph</a>, Redd Angelo, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Red_Barn_(Unsplash).jpg\">A red barn half hidden by trees and tall grass</a>, Hauke Irrgang, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Barn_in_the_mountains_(Unsplash).jpg\">A lone barn below a jagged mountain range</a>, adrian, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Old_barn_in_a_misty_field_(Unsplash_kF3EpcSjGc4).jpg\">Mist lifting from green hills and a small barn</a>, Fritz Bielmeier, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yellow_meadow_and_a_cabin_(Unsplash).jpg\">A yellow field under a wide cloudy sky</a>, Ales Krivec, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rustic_fence_by_a_meadow_(Unsplash).jpg\">A wooden fence along a green meadow</a>, corina, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Green_meadow_at_sunset_(Unsplash).jpg\">Low sun behind a lone pine at the edge of a meadow</a>, Les Anderson, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Glowing_meadow_in_summer_(Unsplash).jpg\">Tall grass lit gold at the end of the day</a>, James Pritchett, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hanging_paper_lanterns_(Unsplash).jpg\">Paper lanterns in orange and cream, hung overhead</a>, Alphacolor 13, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Paper_lamps_hanging_from_a_tree_(Unsplash).jpg\">Red paper lanterns on a bare branch above the water</a>, Alisa Anton, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Candle_in_candle_holder_(Unsplash).jpg\">A single candle in a brass holder on a wooden table</a>, Janko Ferlič, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Red_candlesticks_(Unsplash).jpg\">Three candles by a bright window with paper flags behind</a>, Kris Atomic, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Black-eyed_Susan_flowers_in_a_meadow_(Unsplash).jpg\">Black-eyed Susans in full bloom</a>, Rick Hinchcliff, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Greener_Pastures_(Unsplash).jpg\">Storm clouds over a green field and a long low barn</a>, jesse, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A late-summer wedding in a hill barn, with lanterns, candles and a field that did most of the decorating."},"author":25,"categories":[1],"tags":[15,5],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":25,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":33,"slug":"a-walled-garden-in-peony-season","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2025/06/a-walled-garden-in-peony-season/","date_gmt":"2025-06-10T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A walled garden in peony season"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Peonies are in flower for about two weeks, and a wedding in that window is a gift. The garden belonged to a family who had kept it for forty years, and every bed was full.</p>\n<p>I like to photograph flowers separately from the people. It gives the couple a quiet set of pictures to keep, and it gives me something to do while the family photographs are being arranged.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-01.jpg\" alt=\"Pink rose growing on a white garden trellis\" width=\"1066\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A pink rose climbing a white trellis.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-02.jpg\" alt=\"Dense mass of ruffled pink peonies\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A bed of pink peonies, close together.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-03.jpg\" alt=\"Two pale pink peonies on a soft grey-blue background\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1026\"><figcaption>Two pale peonies against a grey-blue ground.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-04.jpg\" alt=\"Two cupped hands holding a pink flower against a dark background\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Two hands holding a single pink flower.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The morning was soft and overcast. That kind of light is kind to pink and white petals, and it lets you shoot from any direction.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-05.jpg\" alt=\"Close view of pink and white hydrangea flowers\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Pink hydrangea heads, close up.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-06.jpg\" alt=\"Purple lavender flowers in a field with a soft green horizon\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Rows of lavender in a wide field.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-07.jpg\" alt=\"Loose bouquet of pink and cream flowers against a deep pink wall\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A loose bouquet in pink, cream and green on a magenta wall.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-08.jpg\" alt=\"White and pink ranunculus on a wooden barrel against brick\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>White and pink ranunculus laid on a wooden barrel.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The flowers</h2>\n<p>Bouquets look different in every setting. On a plain wall they look tidy. On wood or brick they look relaxed. I tried each of them against a different background and kept the ones where the colours held.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-09.jpg\" alt=\"Bouquet wrapped in paper held at hip height\" width=\"1066\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A paper-wrapped bouquet, held low.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-10.jpg\" alt=\"Pale sandals and a bouquet of pink flowers on weathered wood\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Pale sandals and a bouquet on a weathered plank.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-11.jpg\" alt=\"Tightly packed yellow, white and blue flowers\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Yellow, white and blue flowers packed tightly.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-12.jpg\" alt=\"Two wedding rings resting in a succulent in a white pot\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1068\"><figcaption>Two rings set in a small grey-green succulent.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-13.jpg\" alt=\"Two small gold rings on a white surface\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Two small rings on a plain white surface.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The small things</h2>\n<p>Rings, sandals, a card, a ribbon. They take two minutes to arrange and give the whole story a beginning. I keep a flat white board in my bag for these.</p>\n<p>The ceremony was short and the lunch was long. By four the petals had started to drop, and the garden looked as if it had been a little bit less careful all day.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>This is sample content for the Second Shooter template. The story is invented, and the photographs are public domain or CC0 pictures from Wikimedia Commons, so each caption describes only what is in the picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Supple_pink_peonies_(Unsplash).jpg\">Featured photograph</a>, Kristine Weilert, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Roses_2016-06-08_(Unsplash).jpg\">A pink rose climbing a white trellis</a>, Alex Blăjan, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dense_pink_peonies_(Unsplash).jpg\">A bed of pink peonies, close together</a>, Mira Bozhko, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Peonies_with_white_space_(Unsplash).jpg\">Two pale peonies against a grey-blue ground</a>, Annie Spratt, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Holding_a_pink_peony_(Unsplash).jpg\">Two hands holding a single pink flower</a>, Matthew Henry, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hortensia_(Unsplash).jpg\">Pink hydrangea heads, close up</a>, Giuseppe Murabito, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lavender_field_(Unsplash).jpg\">Rows of lavender in a wide field</a>, Annie Spratt, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gorgeous_bouquet_on_purple_background_(Unsplash).jpg\">A loose bouquet in pink, cream and green on a magenta wall</a>, Mira Bozhko, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rural_bouquet_(Unsplash).jpg\">White and pink ranunculus laid on a wooden barrel</a>, Alisa Anton, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Paper-wrapped_bouquet_(Unsplash).jpg\">A paper-wrapped bouquet, held low</a>, Lizzie, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Bouquet_(Unsplash).jpg\">Pale sandals and a bouquet on a weathered plank</a>, Sweet Ice Cream Photography, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Magnificent_bouquet_from_above_(Unsplash).jpg\">Yellow, white and blue flowers packed tightly</a>, Chelsea Francis, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_rings_(Unsplash).jpg\">Two rings set in a small grey-green succulent</a>, Artsy Vibes, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wedding_rings_2017_(Unsplash).jpg\">Two small rings on a plain white surface</a>, Melinda Pack, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A small garden wedding in the two weeks when the peonies are open, with the flowers photographed on their own."},"author":25,"categories":[1],"tags":[16,17],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":25,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":34,"slug":"vineyards-valleys-and-waterfalls","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2025/04/vineyards-valleys-and-waterfalls/","date_gmt":"2025-04-22T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"Vineyards, valleys and waterfalls"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Spring is the best time for this valley. The vines are bright green, the hills are still soft and the waterfalls are full from the winter. This guide covers the vineyard roads first, then the walk up to the water.</p>\n<p>I have photographed here with three different couples, and every time the light behind the hills decided the plan, so each section starts with a note on timing.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-01.jpg\" alt=\"Long rows of bare vines under a purple and orange sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1060\"><figcaption>Vine rows running to the horizon under a purple sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-02.jpg\" alt=\"Green vine leaves and a long brown hill behind\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Young vine leaves in front of a long brown hill.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-03.jpg\" alt=\"Vineyard posts and young vines in morning mist\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Posts and vines in morning mist.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-04.jpg\" alt=\"Gravel track running between two vineyards under a pink sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A gravel track between two vineyards.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The vineyard roads</h2>\n<p>Go at sunrise or an hour before sunset. The rows give you lines that lead the eye, and a gravel track between two fields works as a ready-made aisle.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-05.jpg\" alt=\"Rolling green hills with vineyards and a lone farmhouse\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Rolling hills, vines and a single farmhouse.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-06.jpg\" alt=\"Wooded hills with a few white houses in hazy light\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1071\"><figcaption>Wooded hills and a few white houses in haze.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-07.jpg\" alt=\"Wide hazy valley in low golden light\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Low light across a wide, hazy valley.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-08.jpg\" alt=\"Low sun between dark pine trunks over a mossy floor\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>The sun setting between dark pines.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-09.jpg\" alt=\"Green valley with a thin river and a small lake in the distance\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1071\"><figcaption>A green valley with a thin river and a small lake.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The valley</h2>\n<p>Drive up to the first lookout when the haze is still low. The hills stack up in layers, and a single house in the middle of them makes the scale clear.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-10.jpg\" alt=\"Sun above a green valley with a bare tree on the rock edge\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1009\"><figcaption>The sun over a valley, with a bare tree at the edge.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-11.jpg\" alt=\"Wide waterfall dropping over rock under orange trees\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"><figcaption>A wide waterfall under autumn trees.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-12.jpg\" alt=\"Waterfall in several thin streams above a pebbled pool\" width=\"1440\" height=\"960\"><figcaption>A waterfall in several streams over a pebbled pool.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-13.jpg\" alt=\"Waterfall dropping through bright green forest with sunbeams\" width=\"1440\" height=\"963\"><figcaption>A waterfall dropping through bright green forest.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-14.jpg\" alt=\"Thin waterfall running down a rock wall covered in ivy\" width=\"958\" height=\"1440\"><figcaption>A thin waterfall down a wall of ivy.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The waterfalls</h2>\n<p>The walk takes about forty minutes. Wear shoes with grip, carry a spare cloth for the lens and expect spray. A wider lens works better here than a long one.</p>\n<p>If you can, do the vineyards in the morning and the waterfalls after lunch. The water is in shade by late afternoon, and the green looks deeper.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>This is sample content for the Second Shooter template. The story is invented, and the photographs are public domain or CC0 pictures from Wikimedia Commons, so each caption describes only what is in the picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mountain_village_during_golden_hour_(Unsplash).jpg\">Featured photograph</a>, Johannes Plenio, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vineyard_during_sunrise_(Unsplash).jpg\">Vine rows running to the horizon under a purple sky</a>, Karsten Würth, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vineyard_and_hills_(Unsplash).jpg\">Young vine leaves in front of a long brown hill</a>, Tim Mossholder, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vineyard_during_sunset_(Unsplash).jpg\">Posts and vines in morning mist</a>, Karsten Würth, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dienheim,_Germany_(Unsplash).jpg\">A gravel track between two vineyards</a>, Karsten Würth, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Castellina_In_Chianti_(Unsplash).jpg\">Rolling hills, vines and a single farmhouse</a>, Rowan Heuvel, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Houses_in_a_woody_valley_(Unsplash).jpg\">Wooded hills and a few white houses in haze</a>, Jens Lelie, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sicilian_landscape_(Unsplash).jpg\">Low light across a wide, hazy valley</a>, Fré Sonneveld, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Green_grove_during_golden_hour_(Unsplash).jpg\">The sun setting between dark pines</a>, Diana Männik, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Road_to_the_valley_village_(Unsplash).jpg\">A green valley with a thin river and a small lake</a>, Jeff Cooper, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mountain_Valley_(Unsplash).jpg\">The sun over a valley, with a bare tree at the edge</a>, Jasper Boer, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Waterfall_in_autumn_(Unsplash).jpg\">A wide waterfall under autumn trees</a>, Scott Webb, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Peaceful_waterfall_(Unsplash).jpg\">A waterfall in several streams over a pebbled pool</a>, Jeffrey Workman, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_waterfall_in_a_sunny_forest_(Unsplash).jpg\">A waterfall dropping through bright green forest</a>, Kristy Kravchenko, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Waterfall_among_ivy_(Unsplash).jpg\">A thin waterfall down a wall of ivy</a>, Levi Morsy, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A spring guide to a wine valley and the waterfalls above it, with notes on timing, access and light."},"author":25,"categories":[4],"tags":[18,19],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":25,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":35,"slug":"a-lake-at-the-edge-of-the-mountains","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2025/03/a-lake-at-the-edge-of-the-mountains/","date_gmt":"2025-03-04T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A lake at the edge of the mountains"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The lake is a short walk from the last road. In late winter the path is half snow and half mud, which keeps most people away, and the water is still enough to hold a whole mountain upside down.</p>\n<p>They came with one friend as a witness, who also carried the thermos. I took the walk slowly and kept the camera under my coat until we arrived.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-01.jpg\" alt=\"Bright blue lake between rocky mountains with a sharp peak\" width=\"1600\" height=\"821\"><figcaption>A bright blue lake held between rocky shoulders.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-02.jpg\" alt=\"Wide calm lake under a dramatic cloudy sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\"><figcaption>A wide lake under a sky full of cloud.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-03.jpg\" alt=\"Timber railing on a platform above a still lake with pines\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1068\"><figcaption>A timber railing at the edge of a quiet lake.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-04.jpg\" alt=\"Small round lake surrounded by dark snowy mountain peaks\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1098\"><figcaption>A small round lake in a bowl of snowy peaks.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-05.jpg\" alt=\"Grey lake with snow-topped peaks behind a golden hillside\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A grey lake and snow-topped peaks behind a golden hill.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The light came in two parts. First a flat grey that made the water look like metal, then, around ten, a gap in the cloud and a few minutes of real sun on the peaks.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-06.jpg\" alt=\"Dense dark spruce trees above turquoise lake water\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Dark spruce above turquoise water.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-07.jpg\" alt=\"Snowy peaks reflected in a still lake with mist, in black and white\" width=\"978\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Snowy peaks and their reflection, with mist between.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-08.jpg\" alt=\"Mist over a calm lake with reeds at dawn\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"><figcaption>Mist on the water at first light.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-09.jpg\" alt=\"Snow-capped peak above a green valley under a blue sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>A snowy peak above a green valley.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Standing still</h2>\n<p>The ceremony was held on a wooden platform at the edge of the lake. The wind dropped just as they began, which I did not expect and did not mention.</p>\n<p>We walked out in the early afternoon with cold hands and wet boots. They sent me a message that evening, saying the walk back had been the best part. I think the lake did that.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>This is sample content for the Second Shooter template. The story is invented, and the photographs are public domain or CC0 pictures from Wikimedia Commons, so each caption describes only what is in the picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Moraine_Lake_(Unsplash_xr5whzQaers).jpg\">Featured photograph</a>, Justine Milton, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mountains_reflected_in_a_lake_(Unsplash).jpg\">A bright blue lake held between rocky shoulders</a>, Sergei Akulich, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Peaceful_lake_(Unsplash).jpg\">A wide lake under a sky full of cloud</a>, Blaise Thirard, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lake_seen_from_a_wooden_platform_(Unsplash).jpg\">A timber railing at the edge of a quiet lake</a>, Tim Mossholder, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Clear_lake_in_snowy_mountains_(Unsplash).jpg\">A small round lake in a bowl of snowy peaks</a>, Chris Leipelt, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mountains_by_a_large_lake_(Unsplash).jpg\">A grey lake and snow-topped peaks behind a golden hill</a>, Peter Winckler, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Forest_near_a_turquoise_lake_(Unsplash).jpg\">Dark spruce above turquoise water</a>, Vlad Shapochnikov, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lake_Oeschinen_(Unsplash).jpg\">Snowy peaks and their reflection, with mist between</a>, Kimon Maritz, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Golden_Hour_At_The_Lake_(Unsplash).jpg\">Mist on the water at first light</a>, Aaron Lee, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Picturesque_mountain_valley_(Unsplash).jpg\">A snowy peak above a green valley</a>, Gabriel Garcia Marengo, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A quiet elopement at a mountain lake in late winter, planned around snow, wind and a short walk."},"author":25,"categories":[2],"tags":[20,13],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":25,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":36,"slug":"hands-and-small-things","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2025/01/hands-and-small-things/","date_gmt":"2025-01-14T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"Hands and small things"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>In January I run a small series of sessions for people who do not like being photographed. We stay indoors, near a window, and the pictures are of hands and objects instead of faces.</p>\n<p>It sounds odd until you see the results. A hand holding a cup tells you more about a person than a smile held for a count of three.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-01.jpg\" alt=\"Two hands holding a lit candle in a glass jar against a teal wall\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Two hands around a lit candle.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-02.jpg\" alt=\"Hand with a small pink flower placed on one finger\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>A hand wearing a small pink flower on one finger.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-03.jpg\" alt=\"Several hands tying ribbon on a small wrapped gift\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Hands busy with ribbon and wrapping.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-04.jpg\" alt=\"Lit candle in a dark glass jar on a wooden table\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A candle in a dark glass jar on a wooden table.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>We began with candles, because they give you a reason to hold still. The warm light on the hands makes everyone look calmer than they feel.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-05.jpg\" alt=\"Glass holding green sprigs on a balcony table above trees\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1060\"><figcaption>A glass of green sprigs on a balcony table.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-06.jpg\" alt=\"Open tin box filled with ribbon, thread and tape\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1134\"><figcaption>A tin of old ribbon and thread.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-07.jpg\" alt=\"Small purple flowers in a white vase on a wooden table\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Purple flowers in a white vase on a wooden table.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-08.jpg\" alt=\"Single pink flower in a small green vase casting a long shadow\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>One pink flower in a small green vase, with a long shadow.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The table</h2>\n<p>After an hour we moved to the table by the window. Whatever was already there became the subject: a vase, a tin of old ribbon, a glass of green sprigs.</p>\n<p>People often ask to see more of the face after this. I say yes, when they ask. Most of them do not, and keep the hands.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>This is sample content for the Second Shooter template. The story is invented, and the photographs are public domain or CC0 pictures from Wikimedia Commons, so each caption describes only what is in the picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hands_in_the_spring_(Unsplash).jpg\">Featured photograph</a>, Tiko Giorgadze, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hands_(Unsplash).jpg\">Two hands around a lit candle</a>, Daiga Ellaby, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flowers_on_Fingers_(Unsplash).jpg\">A hand wearing a small pink flower on one finger</a>, Roman Kraft, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ribbon_decorations_(Unsplash).jpg\">Hands busy with ribbon and wrapping</a>, michael, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Candle_(Unsplash).jpg\">A candle in a dark glass jar on a wooden table</a>, Jeffrey Wegrzyn, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flowers_in_a_glass_vase_(Unsplash).jpg\">A glass of green sprigs on a balcony table</a>, Dominik Martin, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vintage_sewing_box_(Unsplash).jpg\">A tin of old ribbon and thread</a>, Annie Spratt, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Violet_flowers_on_a_table_(Unsplash).jpg\">Purple flowers in a white vase on a wooden table</a>, Brigitte Tohm, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Modest_pink_flowers_in_a_vase_(Unsplash).jpg\">One pink flower in a small green vase, with a long shadow</a>, Kristina M M, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A winter portrait session at home that never shows a face: hands, candles and the objects on a table."},"author":25,"categories":[3],"tags":[21,22],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":25,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":37,"slug":"a-registry-office-and-a-long-lunch","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2024/11/a-registry-office-and-a-long-lunch/","date_gmt":"2024-11-12T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A registry office and a long lunch"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The ceremony took fifteen minutes and the lunch took four hours. That ratio is, in my experience, the right one. A registry office is a good place to start the day because it asks for nothing and leaves everything else to the people.</p>\n<p>I arrived before the couple and walked around the building and the streets nearby, looking for the places where the light would reach after the ceremony.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-01.jpg\" alt=\"Grand stone hall with two staircases, a red carpet and a tall window\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1126\"><figcaption>A grand hall with a wide stair and a red carpet.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-02.jpg\" alt=\"Covered bridge between two old stone buildings with a wooden door\" width=\"1600\" height=\"902\"><figcaption>A covered bridge joining two old stone buildings.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-03.jpg\" alt=\"Wet cobbled street with a puddle and a parked car\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A wet cobbled street after rain.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-04.jpg\" alt=\"Narrow lane between old walls with low houses in warm light\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A narrow lane between old walls, late in the day.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-05.jpg\" alt=\"Old stone town hall seen between modern glass towers\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1060\"><figcaption>An old stone town hall among glass towers.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The stairs were wide and the hall was tall. In rooms like this I shoot wide and from low down, so the architecture holds the people instead of pushing against them.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-06.jpg\" alt=\"Tall arched pillars inside a large church with warm lights\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\"><figcaption>Tall pillars and arches inside a big church.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-07.jpg\" alt=\"Florist table from above with flowers, paper and a laptop\" width=\"1600\" height=\"986\"><figcaption>A florist's work table seen from above.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-08.jpg\" alt=\"Buckets of pink and red carnations in a flower shop\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Buckets of carnations in a flower shop.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-09.jpg\" alt=\"Envelope tied with grey ribbon next to a pencil and green leaves on white\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1068\"><figcaption>An envelope tied with grey ribbon, a pencil beside it.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-10.jpg\" alt=\"Dining room with a fireplace, a mirror and tables set for lunch\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1008\"><figcaption>A dining room with a fireplace and tables laid for lunch.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>After the ceremony</h2>\n<p>We walked. Wet cobbles, a narrow lane between old walls, a few doors that were worth stopping at. I kept the camera down and let them lead.</p>\n<p>Lunch was in a room with a fireplace and long tables. A friend had brought flowers from a market stall, and an envelope with a ribbon went from hand to hand. I put the camera away for the main course.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>This is sample content for the Second Shooter template. The story is invented, and the photographs are public domain or CC0 pictures from Wikimedia Commons, so each caption describes only what is in the picture.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pastel_rose_bouquet_(Unsplash).jpg\">Featured photograph</a>, Jez Timms, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Elegant_entrance_hall_(Unsplash).jpg\">A grand hall with a wide stair and a red carpet</a>, Crew, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:University_Of_Oxford_The_Bridge_Of_Sighs.jpg\">A covered bridge joining two old stone buildings</a>, Michael D Beckwith, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cobblestone_street_(Unsplash).jpg\">A wet cobbled street after rain</a>, Josh Wilburne, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Neighborhood_street_(Unsplash).jpg\">A narrow lane between old walls, late in the day</a>, Daniel Beilinson, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_City_Hall_(Unsplash).jpg\">An old stone town hall among glass towers</a>, Andrew Bae, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cathedral_architecture_(Unsplash).jpg\">Tall pillars and arches inside a big church</a>, Nicolas Brigante, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Table_at_the_florist%27s_(Unsplash).jpg\">A florist's work table seen from above</a>, rawpixel.com, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Roses_at_the_florists_(Unsplash).jpg\">Buckets of carnations in a flower shop</a>, Alisa Anton, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Envelopes_(Unsplash).jpg\">An envelope tied with grey ribbon, a pencil beside it</a>, Joanna Kosinska, CC0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dining_hall_(Unsplash).jpg\">A dining room with a fireplace and tables laid for lunch</a>, Nathan Fertig, CC0</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A civil ceremony in a city registry office, followed by a slow walk through old streets and a long lunch."},"author":25,"categories":[1],"tags":[23,24],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":25,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}}]